body:
后续 transcript 消费契约（先发布，尚未实施）：固定 customType 为 `soroi.eval-lifecycle`。每条记录写入根会话 transcript；data 为下列判别联合，rootSession 始终是持有运行的根 omp session id。

```ts
type Obligation =
  | { kind: "FormalEval"; session: string; evalId: string }
  | { kind: "Batch"; batchId: string; purpose: string };
type LifecycleEntry =
  | { kind: "obligation_registered"; rootSession: string; obligation: Obligation }
  | { kind: "obligation_released"; rootSession: string; obligation: Obligation }
  | { kind: "run_end_requested"; rootSession: string; run: string };
```

`run` 仅在 run_end_requested 上；首次 register 时 store 还可能没有分配 run，不填 null 或推断的 id。FormalEval.session 是实际 writer 会话，evalId 是该次 soroi_eval 的 toolCallId；Batch.batchId/purpose 来自批次拥有方。register/release 条目记录登记表实际登记/释放的 obligation；run_end_requested 在最后一个义务已释放、且即将向 store 发 /end 时记录。三者按实际发生顺序追加，子会话事件也写根 transcript，不写成子 transcript 的副本。

示例（字段示例，不作为运行证据）：
```json
[
 {"customType":"soroi.eval-lifecycle","data":{"kind":"obligation_registered","rootSession":"root-session","obligation":{"kind":"FormalEval","session":"worker-session","evalId":"call-17"}}},
 {"customType":"soroi.eval-lifecycle","data":{"kind":"obligation_released","rootSession":"root-session","obligation":{"kind":"FormalEval","session":"worker-session","evalId":"call-17"}}},
 {"customType":"soroi.eval-lifecycle","data":{"kind":"run_end_requested","rootSession":"root-session","run":"store-assigned-run"}}
]
```

该小改动会在 SOR-03 合并后单独建 issue/PR；SOR-12 接入批次时沿用相同 schema。
